Release Notes BSP-Yocto-Connagtive-i.MX8MM-v1.0
===============================================

- Based on BSP-Yocto-FSL-i.MX8MM-zeus
- Linux Kernel v5.4.70_2.3.2-phy4
- u-boot 2020.04_2.3.2-phy3
- Yocto zeus
- Connagtive IoT Device Suite platform support
- RAUC 1.5.1
- rauc-hawkbit-updater

